00:05:06.556 --> 00:05:08.725
So really, the question for a judge

00:05:08.725 --> 00:05:10.268
is how much time government

00:05:10.268 --> 00:05:12.312
is your case going to take?

00:05:12.645 --> 00:05:14.480
And that's really the critical part.

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:16.607
And then you ask the defense,

00:05:16.607 --> 00:05:18.026
what defense are you going to put on?

00:05:18.026 --> 00:05:18.901
It seems very unlikely

00:05:18.901 --> 00:05:20.486
