00:05:20.486 --> 00:05:21.863
Exactly. And are they?

00:05:21.863 --> 00:05:22.238
Let's say

00:05:22.238 --> 00:05:23.906
Jack Smith says this is a six

00:05:23.906 --> 00:05:24.824
