00:05:39.464 --> 00:05:40.965
You don't have to commit to

00:05:40.965 --> 00:05:42.592
what exactly what you're going to do.

00:05:42.592 --> 00:05:44.427
But if you were to put on a defense,

00:05:44.427 --> 00:05:46.596
how much time do you think it would be?

00:05:46.596 --> 00:05:48.306
And I think the judge can

00:05:48.306 --> 00:05:49.766
