00:05:49.766 --> 00:05:52.602
guess of how much time this would take

00:05:52.602 --> 00:05:54.103
and how long it would be.

00:05:54.103 --> 00:05:55.605
Same thing with the pretrial motions.

00:05:55.605 --> 00:05:56.647
We all know we could.

00:05:56.647 --> 00:05:57.940
Ellie and I could sit here right now

00:05:57.940 --> 00:05:58.900
