00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:46.364
Even even in early voting,

00:06:46.906 --> 00:06:47.990
the judge's role

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:49.784
at a trial is sort of like a ringmaster.

00:06:49.784 --> 00:06:51.661
