00:07:06.717 --> 00:07:08.511
run roughshod. And it's a nightmare.

00:07:08.511 --> 00:07:09.762
I've had other judges

00:07:09.762 --> 00:07:11.097
who have been strict, strict

00:07:11.097 --> 00:07:12.181
but fair and said,

00:07:12.181 --> 00:07:13.182
we're going to get this done

00:07:13.182 --> 00:07:14.350
in X amount of time.

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:16.018
I'm going to give you one week.

00:07:16.018 --> 00:07:16.978
I'm going to give you two weeks.

00:07:16.978 --> 00:07:17.979
I'm going to give you 2 hours

00:07:17.979 --> 00:07:18.980
to give you a closing argument,

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:20.106
not 8 hours.

00:07:20.106 --> 00:07:22.066
And so a lot is going to lie

00:07:22.066 --> 00:07:23.734
on the hands of Judge Chuck Ken.

00:07:23.734 --> 00:07:24.986
And by all indications,

00:07:24.986 --> 00:07:27.697
